  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><strong>Đúng</strong>. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> vuông góc với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><strong>Sai</strong>. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> không có cùng phương nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi>k</mi><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> (với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>k</mi></semantics></math> là số thực khác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math>) trong trường hợp này <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>k</mi></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><strong>Sai</strong>.\n\t\t\t\tDựa vào hình vẽ ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (N).</li><li><strong>Đúng</strong>. Do <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> vuông góc với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> nên chỉ có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math> mới sinh ra chuyển động có gia tốc cho thùng gỗ. <br>\n\t\t\t\tVì vậy từ công thức theo định luật II Newton ta có\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (kg)</mtext></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/887d35249631730e7769785f0c8e846711963ffc69f30dd1c3b6db52f347cbdd.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
